{"title":"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tanya scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> on her math quiz. What percent did she score?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69f215c08d4ca21a50e6a520393017af31cc78e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 75 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 95 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 80 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/2/4e255e29b559ecfc9d152b5d3473461327af03ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d32bd09a562223dc1c8ceeb88e3b482eba81aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" />, so Tanya scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6dfd723dfd931b2b6ef20220d426305a572a7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" /> percent.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_